# Assisted Annual Review Submission

## Who may proxy-submit (self stage only)
- Reporting Manager (`annual_review_instances.manager_id`)
- Skip-Level Manager (`annual_review_instances.skip_id`)
- HR PMS, Admin (via `has_role`)
- Optional per-employee `profiles.designated_proxy_user_id`

## Eligibility (auto-detected)
- Feature flag `app_settings.assisted_self_submission_enabled` must be ON.
- Employee profile has no email OR `auth.users.last_sign_in_at IS NULL`.
- Instance must be at `pending_self`.
- Encapsulated by SECURITY DEFINER fn `public.can_proxy_submit_annual_review(instance_id, proxy_user_id)`.

## Verification (mandatory)
- Live webcam selfie via `getUserMedia({ facingMode:'user' })`. **No file picker is allowed** — capture only.
- Signed declaration checkbox required before submit.
- Stored in private bucket `proxy-selfies` at `{instance_id}/{epochMs}.jpg`.

## Audit trail (immutable)
- Table `annual_review_proxy_submissions` (INSERT + SELECT policies only; no UPDATE/DELETE).
- Captures: instance_id, employee_user_id, proxy_user_id, proxy_role, selfie_path, captured_at, user_agent, declaration_text.
- `annual_review_instances.submitted_via_proxy = true` and `proxy_submission_id` populated on submit.

## Visibility
- Public badge "Submitted with assistance" on instance header.
- Audit row + selfie visible only to: proxy, employee, reporting manager, skip-level, HR PMS, Admin.
- Selfie URLs created via `createSignedUrl` (5 min) — bucket never made public.

## Code map
- DB: `public.can_proxy_submit_annual_review`, `public.submit_annual_review_self_as_proxy` (SECURITY DEFINER).
- Service: `src/services/annualReview/proxySubmission.ts` — `checkProxyEligibility`, `submitWithAssistance`, `getProxyAuditForInstance`, `createSignedSelfieUrl`. Upload is rolled back via `.remove([path])` on any post-upload failure.
- Hook: `src/hooks/useProxyEligibility.ts`.
- UI: `src/components/annual-review/AssistedSubmissionDialog.tsx`, entry point on `src/pages/annual-review/TeamAnnualReview.tsx` (proxy mode is auto-detected at `pending_self` when no native reviewer role applies).
- Admin: `src/components/admin/AssistedSubmissionSettings.tsx` (in SystemSettings → General).

## Constraints
- Never bypass the eligibility RPC client-side. Proxy mode flips on only when `useProxyEligibility` resolves `true` AND no native stage role applies.
- Do not relax the "no file picker" rule. Gallery uploads defeat the verification.
- Audit table must stay append-only. Do not add UPDATE/DELETE policies.